  "distinctness_mechanical": {
    "wald_wolfowitz_runs": "Z_WW=(R-mu_R)/sqrt(var_R) on median-dichotomized sequence (drop ties): R=contiguous same-sign runs, mu_R=1+2*n1*n2/(n1+n2), var_R standard WW. Measures dichotomized-sequence randomness/clustering (negative=clustering, positive=alternation). NON-LOCATION, NON-TP, non-ACF, non-entropy.",
    "non_location_explicit": "NOT a location estimator. Distinct from exhausted location family: C86 Hodges\u2013Lehmann HL=median{(x_i+x_j)/2} (Walsh-average-median rank LOCATION), C85 Gastwirth G=0.3*Q(1/3)+0.4*Q(0.5)+0.3*Q(2/3) (tercile L-estimator LOCATION), C84 Midhinge MH=(Q1+Q3)/2 (quartile LOCATION), C83 Tukey trimean TM=(Q1+2*Q2+Q3)/4 (quartile+median LOCATION). Z_WW is a standardized run-count on a dichotomy.",
    "non_TP_vs_C87": "C87 TP=(1/(n-2))*sum I[(dx_{i-1})*(dx_i)<0] counts LOCAL PEAK/TROUGH REVERSALS of consecutive raw differences (triplet oscillation). Z_WW dichotomizes vs median then counts CONTIGUOUS SAME-SIDE RUNS of the binary sequence \u2014 different operation (median dichotomy + run-length grouping) and different null/normalization (random runs expectation). Mechanically distinct statistics.",
    "vs_autocorr": "ACF(1) is LINEAR lag-1 covariance/correlation of the continuous series; Z_WW operates on a BINARY dichotomized sequence and counts RUNS (nonlinear clustering structure) with a randomness null.",
    "vs_C41C42C43_entropy": "Permutation/sample/Shannon entropy map patterns to symbol probabilities (information/complexity). Z_WW is a single standardized run-count on a median dichotomy, not distributional entropy over ordinal symbols.",
    "vs_C82_AAD_C80_MAD": "AAD/MAD are SCALE/DISPERSION of deviations, not runs/randomness of a dichotomized sequence.",
    "vs_C66_C73_quantile_dispersions_asymmetries": "dichotomized-sequence clustering measure, not cross-sectional quantile spread/asymmetry.",
    "vs_skewness_bowley_kelly_kurtosis": "distributional shape/asymmetry/tail, not run clustering.",
    "vs_C79_SarleBC_C45_CV_C51C74C75C76C78_inequality": "shape/scale/concentration, not temporal runs randomness.",
    "vs_C23_other_RQV": "rolling Wald\u2013Wolfowitz standardized runs statistic on median-dichotomized volume path; different transform family.",
    "data_source_identical_transform_mechanically_different": true
  },
